UDS Deploy UI / UDS Watch

Portions of the read-only reader, output capture, artifact views, web interface,
and regression tests derive from the Apache-2.0-licensed deployment watcher in
sonic-swf-iac (scripts/uds_deploy and associated tests), based on revision
ab9ba3e9f3c25c1a7a8904a9b645b3e6cc965439 with subsequent interface refinements.
These files have been adapted for standalone use. Deployment scheduling,
retry execution, infrastructure configuration, and private captures are omitted.

GitLab Sans and GitLab Mono are redistributed under SIL OFL 1.1. Their
unmodified font files, copyright/license notices, and source provenance are in
src/uds_deploy/web/fonts/.

